WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.137 --> 00:00:01.078
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

2
00:00:02.064 --> 00:00:05.738
<v><b>Stella:</b></v> <i>All Quiet on the Western Front</i> is on Netflix.

3
00:00:05.844 --> 00:00:07.195
Have you seen it?

4
00:00:07.362 --> 00:00:12.159
<v><b>Paul:</b></v> The German one that won lots of Oscars not so long ago? Yes, I have.

5
00:00:12.265 --> 00:00:13.601
And I’ve read the book.

6
00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:17.381
The book’s better than the film, I think. It’s a classic!

7
00:00:17.532 --> 00:00:20.462
<v><b>Stella:</b></v> Do you mind watching it again with me?

8
00:00:20.705 --> 00:00:22.648
I really want to see it.

9
00:00:26.989 --> 00:00:27.839
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

10
00:00:28.841 --> 00:00:31.300
<v><b>Matt:</b></v> Have you read the Sherlock Holmes books?

11
00:00:31.361 --> 00:00:32.909
<v><b>Tom:</b></v> No, I haven’t.

12
00:00:33.061 --> 00:00:36.158
There are so many of them! Life’s too short!

13
00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:38.032
<v><b>Matt:</b></v> Have you watched <i>Sherlock</i>?

14
00:00:38.108 --> 00:00:43.436
<v><b>Tom:</b></v> Yes, I’ve watched the first three seasons, and I’ve downloaded the fourth.

15
00:00:45.364 --> 00:00:46.487
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

16
00:00:47.709 --> 00:00:51.945
<v><b>Lexi:</b></v> Have you seen <i>Les Misérables</i>? The musical, I mean.

17
00:00:52.036 --> 00:00:57.409
<v><b>Mason:</b></v> I’ve seen the film, but I haven’t seen it at the theatre. I’d love to go.

18
00:00:57.515 --> 00:01:02.525
<v><b>Lexi:</b></v> Let’s book tickets, then. I’ve read the book and I love the music!